    "tool": "tools/catalog/emit_catalog.py",
    "notes": "Options from the Grapevine menus, with `allow_custom` on so held free-text values stay valid.",
    "type_species_notes": "`type_species` maps each individual Fera Type to the shared family name `fera-gifts` groups its own powers under (Bastet's nine breeds share one `Bastet` Gift list; Mokole-mbembe, Makara and Zhong Lung all read `Mokole`'s). Verified against Mind's Eye Theatre Changing Breeds 1-3 and Hengeyokai: Nuwisha, Corax, Bastet's nine breeds (WW05019); Gurahl and its four tribes, Mokole and its Varna/stream names Makara and Zhong Lung (WW05024); Ananasi, Ratkin (WW05034); Kitsune (WW05036). Buzzard maps to itself - real, structured `Gifts, Buzzard`/`Rites, Buzzard` menu data exists in the legacy Grapevine source, but no Changing Breeds or Hengeyokai sourcebook in this library names it as a real Fera type; left in place, not removed, since it predates this catalog and isn't this pass's to adjudicate. Ajaba, Bitter-Grin, Breaker, Dumenkara, Gumagan, Hishtpah, Nagah, Purgers, Rokea, Vermin have no confirmed Gift-family match in this library and are left out of the map, reading as out of type until real per-species research is done. Gnosis/Rage/Willpower `start` values are only built for Nuwisha, Bastet and Gurahl this pass; Mokole's own Homid/Suchid breed Gnosis plus its six-Varna Rage table and auspice-Gift budget are real, book-confirmed (WW05024) but not yet wired into `creation_rules` - a Mokole character's resource pools stay a manual Storyteller entry until that's built."
  },
